WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-US

00:00:15.473 --> 00:00:19.310
The dance of Los Mirlos.

00:01:11.321 --> 00:01:12.822
Sabor! Sabor!

00:01:51.194 --> 00:01:55.448
Hands in the air, hands in the air, hands in the air.

00:01:55.490 --> 00:02:04.666
Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey,hey, hey, hey! All right!

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:06.459
Let's go, let's go!

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:20.348
Let's go, let's go!

00:03:07.770 --> 00:03:12.317
Los Mirlos. Los Mirlos, inspired by the majesty of the Amazon.

00:03:12.317 --> 00:03:15.653
By the diversity of its cultures and the richness of its traditions.

00:03:15.695 --> 00:03:18.239
We pay tribute to the Amazon rainforest.

00:03:18.239 --> 00:03:23.828
To its riches, its mysteries, myths and legends that are the spirit and heartbeat of the jungle.

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:27.373
So that you feel the magic, the charm and the sound of the jungle.

00:03:27.373 --> 00:03:29.334
Los Mirlos.

00:03:36.925 --> 00:03:39.844
"The Cumbia of the Jaguar." Let's go.

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:47.268
Clap your hands. Clap your hands. Hands up, up, up, up, up.

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:58.071
That's it. Ay, ay, ay, ay, ay, ay, ay, ay, ay, ay,ay, ay, ay!

00:04:09.415 --> 00:04:12.210
Dance, dance, dance. Dance. Dance

00:04:16.506 --> 00:04:19.008
Cumbia. Cumbia. Cumbia. Cumbia. Cumbia.

00:04:21.094 --> 00:04:22.595
Amazonian.

00:04:36.609 --> 00:04:38.403
From the Peruvian Amazon.

00:04:41.281 --> 00:04:45.201
To the United States and the world.

00:04:45.743 --> 00:04:46.536
Let's go.

00:04:50.498 --> 00:04:55.253
Hands in the air. Up, up, up, up.

00:05:06.180 --> 00:05:06.806
Wepa!

00:05:09.142 --> 00:05:13.855
The Cumbia of the Jaguar. Nice.

00:05:54.312 --> 00:05:57.607
Keep going, keep going, keep going, keep going, keep going.

00:06:10.453 --> 00:06:11.996
Cumbia. Cumbia. Cumbia.

00:06:13.414 --> 00:06:14.499
Of the Jaguar.

00:06:33.351 --> 00:06:38.147
Amazonian cumbia is a celebration, but it is also the voice of the earth.

00:06:38.147 --> 00:06:42.485
Listen closely to the guitars, that is how the jungle roars when it cried for help.

00:06:42.485 --> 00:06:47.532
We dedicate this song to all our Indigenous brothers and sisters who defend the lungs of the world.

00:06:47.573 --> 00:06:49.492
Even with their own lives.

00:07:05.174 --> 00:07:06.008
Lament.

00:07:07.802 --> 00:07:10.012
Lament in the jungle.

00:08:07.278 --> 00:08:12.200
Go over there. Let's go. Let's go, let's go, let's go.

00:08:15.328 --> 00:08:20.249
The jungle weeps in sorrow over the departure of my brothers.

00:08:20.291 --> 00:08:23.920
We remember them and sing to them with this lament.

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:25.838
Lament in the jungle.

00:08:39.894 --> 00:08:41.312
All right.

00:09:22.228 --> 00:09:24.105
Keep it going, keep it going.

00:09:25.106 --> 00:09:30.027
The jungle weeps in sorrow over the departure of my brothers.

00:09:30.027 --> 00:09:35.533
We remember them and sing to them with this lament,
lament in the jungle.

00:09:50.965 --> 00:09:52.049
Thank you very much.

00:09:52.550 --> 00:09:56.679
Los Mirlos is a musical group.

00:09:58.806 --> 00:10:04.687
Sharing music and culture from the Peruvian Amazon for more than 52 years.

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:08.733
My origins, my beloved homeland Moyobamba, the heart of the Amazon.

00:10:08.774 --> 00:10:10.067
Very pleased, very happy.

00:10:10.067 --> 00:10:12.028
We continue enjoying these beautiful songs.

00:10:12.028 --> 00:10:14.447
Let's go with Los Mirlos. Play it!

00:10:25.082 --> 00:10:33.966
A night of love. Let's go!

00:10:42.850 --> 00:10:46.437
Keep it up. Keep it up. Keep on going.

00:10:59.617 --> 00:11:05.665
When the jungle makes a sound, Los Mirlos sing.

00:11:32.400 --> 00:11:34.777
Night falls. Night falls.

00:11:34.819 --> 00:11:36.153
Night falls.

00:12:00.219 --> 00:12:01.887
Cumbia, cumbia, cumbia.

00:12:05.057 --> 00:12:08.352
Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey!

00:12:20.531 --> 00:12:22.533
A night of cumbia.

00:12:24.869 --> 00:12:26.495
With you, my love.

00:12:50.895 --> 00:12:52.021
The night.

00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:12.541
That's it!

00:13:31.435 --> 00:13:32.645
The night.

00:13:46.116 --> 00:13:53.541
We Peruvians have been blessed with three beautiful regions in Peru.

00:13:54.166 --> 00:13:58.629
As Peruvians, we truly feel very happy, very pleased.

00:13:58.671 --> 00:14:03.509
To have three regions: the coastal region on the shores of the Pacific Ocean,

00:14:03.676 --> 00:14:09.306
the Andean region, where Cusco, Machu Picchu, and other beautiful cities are.

00:14:09.515 --> 00:14:15.771
And the Amazon region, my homeland, Moyobamba, and the entire Peruvian Amazon.

00:14:15.813 --> 00:14:17.940
Truly, we are very happy.

00:14:18.816 --> 00:14:21.443
Long live Peru! Live!

00:14:22.152 --> 00:14:24.613
Long live the Amazon! Live!

00:14:25.155 --> 00:14:28.200
Long live the world! Live!

00:14:28.284 --> 00:14:31.996
Congratulations!

00:14:32.121 --> 00:14:35.916
And now, everyone dance "La Pandilla"!

00:14:40.087 --> 00:14:42.715
For all the towns of the Peruvian Amazon.

00:14:44.049 --> 00:14:56.103
Moyobamba, Pucallpa, Iquitos, Tingo María, Yurimaguas, Tarapoto.

00:14:56.645 --> 00:15:00.524
Puerto Maldonado and the entire Peruvian Amazon.

00:15:00.608 --> 00:15:04.778
Let's go. Ay, ay, ay, ay, ay, ay, ay, ay, ay!

00:15:07.531 --> 00:15:14.163
Ay! Ay! Ay!

00:15:20.669 --> 00:15:26.675
Doña Guillermina, let's dance. Doña Guillermina. Let's dance.

00:15:26.759 --> 00:15:28.302
Grab your partner.

00:15:28.344 --> 00:15:29.762
Let's jump.

00:15:29.803 --> 00:15:32.806
Grab your partners. Let's jump.

00:15:32.973 --> 00:15:35.851
The group dances, I dance too.

00:15:35.976 --> 00:15:38.896
The group dances, I'll dance too.

00:15:39.146 --> 00:15:41.982
Come on, come on, everyone. Everyone dance.

00:15:42.066 --> 00:15:45.069
Come on, come on, everyone. Everyone have fun.

00:16:05.798 --> 00:16:15.474
Ay! Ay! Ay! Ay!

00:16:18.936 --> 00:16:21.689
Doña Guillermina, let's dance.

00:16:21.689 --> 00:16:24.858
Doña Guillermina, let's dance.

00:16:24.900 --> 00:16:27.861
Grab your partners, let's dance.

00:16:27.987 --> 00:16:30.990
Grab your partners, let's jump.

00:16:31.240 --> 00:16:33.951
The group dances, I dance too.

00:16:34.201 --> 00:16:37.037
The group dances, I dance too.

00:16:37.246 --> 00:16:40.040
Come on, come on, everyone. Everyone dance.

00:16:40.332 --> 00:16:43.293
Come on, come on, everyone. Everyone enjoy.

00:16:50.968 --> 00:16:56.306
Come on, come on, come on! That's it.

00:17:21.457 --> 00:17:25.002
Stomp, stomp, stomp, stomp, stomp.

00:18:03.540 --> 00:18:07.461
Well, thank you very much for being here. To all the ladies, to all the gentlemen, truly.

00:18:07.461 --> 00:18:11.090
We Los Mirlos feel very happy to be here at this grand event.

